            "id": "t00-033",
            "phase": "evidence",
            "lesson": 8,
            "lessonTitle": "Evidence Database",
            "speaker": "female-detective",
            "type": "instruction",
            "text": "Open the evidence tied to the break-in — the broken display case latch — read its details, and add a note about what you find.",
